\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146720/extras/29793f2c8149e717315375f251af9176.poster.avif?t=1750818394\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146720/extras/29793f2c8149e717315375f251af9176.webm?t=1750818394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146720/extras/29793f2c8149e717315375f251af9176.mp4?t=1750818394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
